Livemetry Pulse — BETA edition marker.
The mere presence of this file next to the executable (or in the
PyInstaller bundle) switches the app to the beta edition: data is
stored under <LOCALAPPDATA>/LivemetryPulseBeta and the keyring
service gains a -Beta suffix, so the beta build never touches the
release build's settings, licence, databases or stored keys.
See core/app_edition.py and BETA_INSTALLER.md.
version=1.6.0-beta.1
